{"sourceUrl":"https://xinxi.hnust.edu.cn/tzgg/8ac0890333994a35a55109e4c436d0ee.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:21.914043+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://xinxi.hnust.edu.cn/tzgg/8ac0890333994a35a55109e4c436d0ee.htm","html":"<div>\n\n\n\n<p><span><span>为进一步推动实施</span></span><span><span>我</span></span><span><span>校</span><span>“1545”办学治校行动计划</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>实现学位与研究生教育向培养高层次创新型应用人才全面转型，促进各高校大学生之间的学术交流，我院特决定举办</span><span>“202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年大学生学术夏令营</span><span>”。现将有关事项通知如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>一、工作安排</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>营员报名</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>：</span></span></strong><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>5日-6月19</span></span><span><span>日（学</span></span><span><span>院根据报名情况可提前结束报名）</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>营员选拔：</span></span></strong><span><span>将根据申请人的学习成绩、综合素</span></span><span><span>质</span></span><span><span>等条件择优遴选，夏令营营员名单将在我院官网公布。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>夏令营开营：</span></span></strong><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>7月</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>上午。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、申请条件</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>1.政治素养：</span></strong><span><span>具有良好的政治素质和思想道德素养，政治立场坚定，德智体美劳全面发展，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>2.外语水平：</span></strong><span><span>具有较好的外语听、说、读、写能力。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>3.综合素养：</span></strong><span><span>有较好的专业理论基础和良好的科研潜力。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三、报名及选拔流程</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>1.</span></strong><strong><span><span>填写申请表</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>在本通知附件中下载</span><span>“</span></span><span><span>湖南科技大学</span></span><span><span>信息与电气工程</span></span><span><span>学院学院</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年大学生学术夏令营申请表</span></span><span><span>”，如实填写相关信息（注：申请表可以打印，但须手写签名确认）。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>2.</span></strong><strong><span><span>报名材料</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>①湖南科技大学</span></span><span><span>信息与电气工程</span></span><span><span>学院</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年大学生学术夏令营申请表（须手写签名）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>②本科成绩单与总评成绩排名证明（由教务处盖章或学院盖章）各1份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>③个人简历1份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>④身份证（正反面）、学生证复印件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>⑤外语水平证明材料复印件（包括大学英语四、六级考试成绩单、TOEFL成绩单、GRE/GMAT成绩单、PETS5成绩单或其他语种的等级证书等）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>⑥其他证明材料（如获奖证书、学术论文等）。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>3.</span></strong><strong><span><span>发送邮件报名</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>请于</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>6月</span></span><span><span>19</span></span><span><span>日</span><span>24:00前将上述材料扫描电子档（PDF格式）发送至学院邮箱：</span></span><span><span><span>2395263060@qq.com</span></span></span><span><span>，（邮件主题标明</span><span>“XX大学-XX院系</span></span><span><span>（报名学院）</span></span><span><span>-姓名-夏令营申请”，如：湖南工业大学-交通与电气工程学院-张三-夏令营申请）（</span></span><strong><span><span>注：根据报名情况可提前结束报名</span></span></strong><span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>4.</span></strong><strong><span><span>材料审核及营员选拔</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学院将逐一审核申请人提供的各项材料，择优确定夏令营营员名单。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四、活动安排</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>本次夏令营采取线下形式进行，具体安排包括：</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>1.</span></strong><strong><span><span>开营典礼：</span></span></strong><span><span>由学校统一组织。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>2.</span></strong><strong><span><span>讲座与交流：</span></span></strong><span><span>专家讲座、师生互动、</span></span><span><span>学术</span></span><span><span>交流等。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>3.</span></strong><strong><span><span>素质拓展：</span></span></strong><span><span>户外团建、团队协作、沟通能力等。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、政策支持</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>1.学习保障：</span></strong><span><span>学院安排资深专业教师担任班主任，安排成长辅导员。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>2.食宿安排：</span></strong><span><span>学校为所有营员提供免费用餐（餐标：</span><span>50元/天）；为所有校外营员提供免费住宿（双标或单间）；为所有营员免费提供统一着装（文化衫</span></span><span><span>1件</span></span><span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>3.交通补助：</span></strong><span><span>为鼓励校外高校大学生报名，对省外高校营员提供</span><span>150元</span></span><span><span>/人</span></span><span><span>交通补助，对省内校外营员提供</span><span>75元</span></span><span><span>/人</span></span><span><span>交通补助。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>4.安全保障：</span></strong><span><span>为全体营员购买意外伤害保险。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>六、联系方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>交流</span><span>QQ群：</span></span><span><span><span>653628797；</span></span></span><span><span>请实名（格式：</span><span>“XX大学-XX院系-姓名”，如：湖南工业大学-</span></span><span><span><span>交通与电气</span>工程</span></span><span><span>学院</span><span>-张三）加入“</span></span><span><span>信息与电气工程</span></span><span><span>学院</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年学术夏令营</span><span>”QQ群。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电</span>  <span>话：</span></span><span><span>0731-58290727</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：</span></span><span><span>喻</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span></span></span><a href=\"https://xinxi.hnust.edu.cn/docs/2026-06/8823b8f433b744da8081d6f5b862d858.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件：湖南科技大学信息与电气工程学院2026年大学生学术夏令营申请表</a><span><span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>湖南科技大学</span></span><span><span>信息与电气工程</span></span><span><span>学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n\n\n</div>","textSha256":"25932e0a2788c8c18f1a09c3f79246c506212ce9c35a7ab5fcdad82421fe0844","textLength":1244,"sourceSha256":"c130a3c72acc9df8bb3aa36b7cf3a7f227c6ff8fea514ad1ec3ef8e4c9cd3dc6","selector":"article-like:article","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-817c95e6a5a9a4e61d7e","title":"2026年湖南科技大学信息与电气工程学院“2026年大学生学术夏令营”报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:21.914043+00:00"}
